## Documentation structure

- Confirm docs.root and configured subpaths are normalized target-relative
  paths without traversal or unresolved values.
- Confirm docs.categories remains ordered, unique, and limited to safe
  single-directory names; no category may equal the final docs.root directory
  name.
- Confirm every configured category has one index and every index links back
  to /{{docs.root}}/README.md.
- Confirm the root index links each category through /{{docs.root}}/ and has no
  ambiguous or stale destination.
- Confirm category indexes, decision records, governance templates, and other
  owned outputs do not collide.
- Keep durable documentation authoritative; .agents guidance should route to
  it rather than duplicate it.
